# tests/fixtures/cmudict-sample.dict -- a cut of CMUdict for the suite.
#
# Each line is here because it decides something: a comment to strip, a
# variant to skip, a rhotic vowel standing in for an R, a three-consonant
# cluster, an unstressed AH that is a schwa and a stressed one that is
# not, and a one-syllable word that must get no stress mark.
aalborg AO1 L B AO0 R G # place, danish
world W ER1 L D
library L AY1 B R EH2 R IY0
street S T R IY1 T
think TH IH1 NG K
mother M AH1 DH ER0
water W AO1 T ER0
people P IY1 P AH0 L
read R EH1 D
read(2) R IY1 D
station S T EY1 SH AH0 N
see S IY1
half HH AE1 F
vibe V AY1 B
family F AE1 M AH0 L IY0
